  "judgeReason": "Variant 2 is the most polished set. The profile cards read clearly, with a tidy glow pulse and sparkle between frames. The gold badge uses a strong dark cross that holds up against the night sky, and its second frame adds a clear glow change. The trophy has the cleanest shading: a highlight at upper left, brown on the right edge and a solid dark base. Variant 1's trophy uses orange as a shadow tone, which looks noisy. Variant 3's orange-gold coin is muddier and less readable."
